@startuml
title State diagram for BPO Management System Search Functionality

[*] --> InitialState : Start

state "Initial" as InitialState
state "Filter Selection" as FilterSelection
state "Search Processing" as SearchProcessing
state "Results Displayed" as ResultsDisplayed

InitialState --> FilterSelection : Select Category
FilterSelection --> SearchProcessing : Select Price Range
SearchProcessing --> ResultsDisplayed : Process Search
ResultsDisplayed --> [*] : End

[*] --> InitialState : Start
InitialState -> FilterSelection : Select Category or Price Range
FilterSelection --> SearchProcessing : Select Price Range
SearchProcessing --> ResultsDisplayed : Process Search
ResultsDisplayed --> [*] : End
@enduml
